          "title": "《宋史》卷三百八十五·周葵傳",
          "source_bid": "d59f2gonq7sy",
          "details": "孝宗思其言，拜參知政事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "office_id": "hixi4ugstvk2",
      "text": "大學士",
      "sources": [
